 "synopsis": "Seven initial public offerings are scheduled to open for subscription during the week beginning September 21, 2026, aiming to raise more than Rs 4,900 crore cumulatively. The companies launching their IPOs include Varmora Granito aiming to raise Rs 708 crore, Elevate Campuses aiming to raise Rs 2,100 crore, ArMee Infotech looking to raise Rs 300 crore, Swastika Infra planning to raise Rs 161 crore, Adroit Industries (India) looking to raise Rs 151 crore, A-One Steels India aiming to mobilise Rs 405 crore, and digital lending platform Moneyview with an issue size of Rs 1,092 crore. Additional listings including National Stock Exchange of India and Hero Motors are also scheduled for the week.",
